<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 17 May 2026</p>
<p>These Terms and Conditions govern the rental contract between <strong>KS Rent S.R.L.</strong> (the "Lessor") and the customer (the "Renter") hiring a vehicle from the fleet. By signing the rental contract or confirming the booking online, the Renter declares to have read and accepted these conditions.</p>

