<p>The Lessor accepts the following payment methods for both balance and deposit: cash (in euros), bank transfer (also instant), reloadable prepaid cards (Postepay, Revolut, N26, Hype, Wise), debit and bancomat cards (VISA/Maestro/Mastercard), traditional credit cards, contactless NFC payments (Apple Pay, Google Pay). <strong>A traditional credit card is not required.</strong></p>

