<p>On vehicle delivery the Renter pays a security deposit proportionate to the vehicle category. The exact amount is communicated at booking, before confirmation. The deposit may be paid in cash, prepaid, debit or credit card. At the end of the rental, if the vehicle is returned intact, without damage or pending fines, the deposit is refunded through the same payment method within 24 hours.</p>

<h2>4. Insurance excess and damage liability</h2>
<p>In the event of an accident or vehicle damage, the Renter is liable up to the maximum kasko excess defined for the vehicle category. The Lessor offers an optional excess reduction at rental time, with the additional cost transparently declared. The excess does not apply in case of gross negligence, driving under influence of alcohol/drugs, or use of the vehicle for purposes forbidden by this contract.</p>

